WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.210
This is Karawang.

2
00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:05.640
About a hundred and seventy-five thousand cars

3
00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:08.040
a year come off these lines.

4
00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:10.150
But nearly one in three operators say

5
00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:13.150
they often override the alerts.

6
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.510
So a bad sealer bead travels on,

7
00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:18.750
station after station.

8
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:20.050
It's found late,

9
00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:21.950
far from where it was made.

10
00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:24.830
And the lesson leaves with the shift.

11
00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:28.690
We propose the Learning Line.

12
00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:31.590
Three loops that turn every abnormality into

13
00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:34.370
a standard the whole plant can reuse.

14
00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:35.920
AI detects.

15
00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:37.930
People decide.

16
00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:41.230
Start at the sealer.

17
00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:44.130
A repurposed camera checks every bead.

18
00:00:44.130 --> 00:00:45.940
It learned only from good ones,

19
00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:47.630
so it flags anything different,

20
00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:49.930
and shows where.

21
00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:51.940
The station that made it gets the

22
00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.450
alert. The operator confirms,

23
00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:57.140
or rejects it with a reason.

24
00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:59.690
A yellow andon calls the team leader,

25
00:00:59.690 --> 00:01:01.250
with a suggestion.

26
00:01:01.250 --> 00:01:03.470
The system never stops the line.

27
00:01:03.470 --> 00:01:05.970
The team leader decides.

28
00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:10.630
Here's the working prototype.

29
00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:12.640
Every camera says what it is,

30
00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:14.330
and every replay sits next to the

31
00:01:14.330 --> 00:01:16.480
decision people made.

32
00:01:16.730 --> 00:01:18.810
When the same defect is confirmed three

33
00:01:18.810 --> 00:01:20.150
times in a shift,

34
00:01:20.150 --> 00:01:22.880
a Kaizen ticket opens on its own.

35
00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:25.170
AI drafts the background.

36
00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:28.100
The engineer owns the root cause.

37
00:01:29.850 --> 00:01:32.240
A senior expert validates the fix,

38
00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:34.440
and it becomes a knowledge card.

39
00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:35.690
Ask the line,

40
00:01:35.690 --> 00:01:39.360
and it answers only from validated cards.

41
00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:43.890
Then yokoten carries the new standard to

42
00:01:43.890 --> 00:01:46.900
every sealer that does the same job.

43
00:01:50.150 --> 00:01:51.710
We start small.

44
00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:53.630
Phase one proves it on one sealer

45
00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:55.860
line at Karawang Two,

46
00:01:55.860 --> 00:01:58.550
for nine point two billion rupiah.

47
00:01:58.730 --> 00:02:00.750
Gate one decides before we scale to

48
00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:01.920
both lines,

49
00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:04.120
then to final assembly.

50
00:02:06.170 --> 00:02:07.330
The targets:

51
00:02:07.330 --> 00:02:10.230
overrides below twenty percent by Gate one,

52
00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:12.040
and scrap down from one hundred and

53
00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:16.660
eight to ninety-six by 2028.

54
00:02:17.110 --> 00:02:18.370
AI detects.

55
00:02:18.370 --> 00:02:19.530
People decide.

56
00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:21.000
The line learns.
